Package: qc-quadcapture
Version: 1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-usb, python3-pyqt6
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64
Maintainer: QUAD-CAPTURE Linux driver project <nobody@example.invalid>
Description: Roland QUAD-CAPTURE (0582:012f) driver, daemon and panel
 Patched snd-usb-audio module with all four sample rates and the control
 SysEx channel, a control daemon that keeps the panel from freezing, and a
 Qt control panel with level meters and sample-rate selection.
